        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Electricity, at wind power plant 800kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electricity, at wind power plant 800kW
The capacity factor is assumed to be 20 %, based on average European conditions. Gear oil has to be changed every second year. The lifetime of moving and fixed parts is assumed to be 20 resp. 40 years.;
UUID: 25a227ad-f0a6-3ca5-8fe3-c0429729d1a0
Includes the operation of the wind power plant with the necessary change of gear oil. Also includes the capacity factor, concerning the wind conditions
Location: Data for average European conditions. Can be used for regions with similar wind conditions. 
Technology: Technology of a specific 800 kW wind power plant, representative for average European conditions.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature and statistics. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_25a227ad-f0a6-3ca5-8fe3-c0429729d1a0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
